@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram

[*] --> ReceiveRequest : [user sends video suggestion request]

state "Receive Request" as ReceiveRequest
ReceiveRequest : entry / receive video suggestion request from user
ReceiveRequest : do / identify user who made the request
ReceiveRequest : exit / identify user successfully

state "Identify User" as IdentifyUser
IdentifyUser : entry / user's profile or preferences
IdentifyUser : do / gather information about user
IdentifyUser : exit / user identified successfully

state "Gather Videos" as GatherVideos
GatherVideos : entry / user's profile or preferences
GatherVideos : do / gather different types of videos simultaneously
GatherVideos : exit / videos gathered successfully

state "Add Details" as AddDetails
AddDetails : entry / suggested videos
AddDetails : do / add additional details such as thumbnails and view counts
AddDetails : exit / details added successfully

state "Send Videos" as SendVideos
SendVideos : entry / suggested videos with details
SendVideos : do / send the suggested videos to user
SendVideos : exit / videos sent successfully

ReceiveRequest --> IdentifyUser
IdentifyUser --> GatherVideos
GatherVideos --> AddDetails
AddDetails --> SendVideos

state "Video Suggestion" as VideoSuggestion
VideoSuggestion : entry / video suggestion request received
VideoSuggestion : do / suggest videos to user
VideoSuggestion : exit / video suggestion process completed

SendVideos --> VideoSuggestion
VideoSuggestion --> [*]

@enduml
